{
  "_README": [
    "==================================================================",
    " FERROTAG RULES",
    "==================================================================",
    "This file is OPTIONAL. Ferrotag has sensible built-in defaults, so",
    "'Apply Rules' works without it. Editing this file just lets you",
    "customize what happens — your changes override the built-in ones.",
    "",
    "Rules are applied to every loaded file when you click 'Apply Rules'.",
    "They run top to bottom; nothing is written to disk until you Save.",
    "Each rule is an object with a 'field' and an 'op' (plus extras for",
    "some ops). This '_README' key is ignored — only 'rules' matters.",
    "",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    " OPS (the action a rule performs)",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    "  blank                  clear the field",
    "                         { \"field\": \"genre\", \"op\": \"blank\" }",
    "",
    "  set       (value)      set the field to a fixed value",
    "                         { \"field\": \"encoded_by\", \"op\": \"set\", \"value\": \"ferrotag\" }",
    "                         (omitting 'value' clears the field)",
    "",
    "  pad       (width)      zero-pad a number to 'width' digits",
    "                         '3' -> '03', and '3/12' -> '03/12'",
    "                         non-numeric values are left untouched",
    "                         { \"field\": \"track_number\", \"op\": \"pad\", \"width\": 2 }",
    "",
    "  yearOnly               reduce a date to its first 4-digit year",
    "                         '2021-05-13' -> '2021', '13/05/2021' -> '2021'",
    "                         { \"field\": \"year\", \"op\": \"yearOnly\" }",
    "",
    "  trim                   remove leading/trailing whitespace",
    "                         { \"field\": \"comment\", \"op\": \"trim\" }",
    "",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    " FIELDS (what a rule targets)",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    "  title                  artist                 album",
    "  album_artist           genre                  composer",
    "  track_number           disc_number            bpm",
    "  year                   year_legacy            release_date",
    "  original_release_date  comment                description",
    "  lyricist               conductor              arranger",
    "  remixer                copyright              encoded_by",
    "  sort_title             sort_artist            sort_album",
    "  sort_album_artist",
    "",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    " ACTIVE RULES",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------",
    "The 'rules' list is empty by default, so 'Apply Rules' changes",
    "nothing until you add rules here. A few examples you can copy in:",
    "  { \"field\": \"track_number\", \"op\": \"pad\", \"width\": 2 }",
    "  { \"field\": \"disc_number\", \"op\": \"pad\", \"width\": 2 }",
    "  { \"field\": \"year\", \"op\": \"yearOnly\" }",
    "  { \"field\": \"genre\", \"op\": \"blank\" }",
    "  { \"field\": \"comment\", \"op\": \"set\", \"value\": \"\" }",
    "  { \"field\": \"artist\", \"op\": \"trim\" }"
  ],
  "rules": []
}
